    <div class="crumb" style="margin-top:24px">About</div>
    <h1>About EveVps</h1>
    <p class="lead">Fast, unmanaged Windows RDP and Linux VPS servers in New York, set up automatically and run by you.</p>

    <div class="prose">
      <p><strong>EveVps</strong> provides Windows RDP and Linux VPS servers to individuals and businesses around the world. Our servers run in <strong>New York, USA</strong>.</p>
      <p>You order a server, pay with crypto, and it sets itself up automatically, usually within <strong>1 minute</strong>. After that you run it yourself from your dedicated control panel, while invoices, renewals and support live in the <a href="https://dash.evevps.com/clientarea.php">client area</a>.</p>
    </div>

    <h2 id="provide"><a class="anchor" href="#provide">What we provide</a></h2>
    <div class="cards">
      <a class="card" href="https://dash.evevps.com/store/windows-rdp">
        <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="13" rx="2"/><path d="M8 21h8M12 17v4"/></svg>
        <h3>Windows RDP</h3>
        <p>Windows Server 2019, 2022 or 2025 with a full desktop over Remote Desktop, for trading terminals, Windows apps and remote work.</p>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="https://dash.evevps.com/store/linux-vps">
        <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m4 17 6-6-6-6M12 19h8"/></svg>
        <h3>Linux VPS</h3>
        <p>Ubuntu, Debian, AlmaLinux, Rocky Linux and more with full <code>root</code> access over SSH, for websites, APIs, containers and bots.</p>
      </a>
    </div>
    <div class="prose" style="margin-top:20px"><p>Both come in the same five plans, from <strong>Silver</strong> (2 vCPU, 4 GB RAM) to <strong>Legend</strong> (8 vCPU, 64 GB RAM), starting at $11.99/mo. Every server includes:</p></div>
    <ul class="list">
      <li>a KVM virtual machine with its own kernel and full <code>Administrator</code> or <code>root</code> access</li>
      <li>NVMe SSD storage and a dedicated IPv4 address</li>
      <li>a 1 Gbps network port</li>
      <li>DDoS protection at no extra cost</li>
      <li>a dedicated control panel and unlimited OS reinstalls</li>
    </ul>
    <div class="prose"><p>See all specs and prices in <a href="/docs/getting-started/introduction#plans">Plans and pricing</a>.</p></div>

    <h2 id="how"><a class="anchor" href="#how">How we work</a></h2>
    <div class="prose">
      <p><strong>Automation first.</strong> Ordering, setup, renewals and reinstalls are automated, so you never wait for someone to process an order, and every server is set up the same way.</p>
      <p><strong>Self-service, with people behind it.</strong> You can do almost everything yourself, at any hour. When you need a person, our team answers tickets and email at support@evevps.com, usually within 30 minutes.</p>
      <p><strong>Unmanaged service.</strong> EveVps is an unmanaged service provider. You get full control of your server and are responsible for its operating system, software, security updates and backups. We look after the hardware, network and virtualization, which keeps prices low and lets you set up the server exactly how you want.</p>
      <p><strong>Clear rules.</strong> Our prices, <a href="/docs/terms/refund-policy">refund policy</a> and <a href="https://dash.evevps.com/knowledgebase/18/Terms-of-Service.html">Terms of Service</a> are published in full.</p>
    </div>

    <h2 id="reliability"><a class="anchor" href="#reliability">Reliability</a></h2>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>Live status for our network and servers is published on our <a href="/status">network status page</a>.</p>
      <p>Reliability inside your server depends on you too: keep your own backups and apply updates regularly.</p>
    </div>

    <h2 id="where"><a class="anchor" href="#where">Where our servers run</a></h2>
